[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:53. An Interesting Climate]
[00:01.020]Lesson 53. | 第53课。
[00:03.325]Where do you come from? | 你来自哪里？
[00:05.785]I come from England. | 我来自英格兰。
[00:08.020]What's the climate like in your country? | 你们国家的气候怎么样？
[00:10.940]It's mild, but it's not always pleasant. | 它温和，但并不总是宜人。
[00:15.180]The weather is often cold in the north and windy in the east. | 北方天气常寒冷，东方常刮风。
[00:20.710]It's often wet in the west, and sometimes warm in the south. | 西方常潮湿，南方有时温暖。
[00:27.105]Which seasons do you like best? | 你最喜欢哪个季节？
[00:30.905]I like spring and summer. | 我喜欢春天和夏天。
[00:33.210]The days are long and the nights are short. | 白天长，夜晚短。
[00:36.455]The sun rises early and sets late. | 太阳升得早，落得晚。
[00:41.185]I don't like autumn and winter. | 我不喜欢秋天和冬天。
[00:44.850]The days are short and the nights are long. | 白天短，夜晚长。
[00:48.725]The sun rises late and sets early. | 太阳升得晚，落得早。
[00:52.570]Our climate is not very good, | 我们的气候不是很好，
[00:55.755]but it's certainly interesting. | 但它无疑很有趣。
[00:58.505]It's our favorite subject of conversation. | 这是我们最喜欢的谈话话题。